comment16.target=void\ setServoConfig(int,\ int,\ int)
comment16.text=\ \n\ Servo\ config\n\ --------------------\n\ 0\ \ START_SYSEX\ (0xF0)\n\ 1\ \ SERVO_CONFIG\ (0x70)\n\ 2\ \ pin\ number\ (0-127)\n\ 3\ \ minPulse\ LSB\ (0-6)\n\ 4\ \ minPulse\ MSB\ (7-13)\n\ 5\ \ maxPulse\ LSB\ (0-6)\n\ 6\ \ maxPulse\ MSB\ (7-13)\n\ 7\ \ angle\ LSB\ (0-6)\n\ 8\ \ angle\ MSB\ (7-13)\n\ 9\ \ END_SYSEX\ (0xF7)\n
